Depends: ufw
Maintainer: HCSMEDIA <noreply@hcsmedia.invalid>
Description: HSCL1 security baseline: kernel sysctl hardening and first-boot firewall
 Conservative sysctl hardening and a one-time firewall setup (deny incoming,
 allow outgoing). It never disables AppArmor, Secure Boot or kernel
 mitigations. Made with love by hcsmedia.
